      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1921 Scott shifted to lighter‑than‑air missions, adding an airship hangar that was the second‑largest in the world after Lakehurst’s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
