      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The base’s runways have appeared in Hollywood, featuring in the 2018 film Rampage and the 2021 Netflix movie Don’t Look Up.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
